<title>POLAND: Polish NBP buys dollars at PLN 3.0708-dealers.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP buys dollars at PLN 3.0708-dealers.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland (NBP) bought dollars on the interbank market at 3.0708 zlotys, dealers said.</p>
<p>The intervention, described as &quot;small&quot;, came at 1255 GMT when the zloty was at 3.08 percent from the average weighted dollar and mark parity rates for today -- the centre of the daily 14-percent trading band.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
